  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"menu-route current\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/newsletter/\"><span>Newsletter</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/feedback/\"><span>Get in touch</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"hub-hero\"><div class=\"library-title\"><span class=\"section-label\">Resources</span><h1>Browse<br/><span>resources.</span></h1><p>Videos to watch, courses from independent providers, and reading from beginner guides to research.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Resource types\" class=\"hub-paths hub-paths-static\"><a class=\"hub-path\" href=\"/videos/\"><span class=\"hub-path-image\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-1024.webp 1024w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"646\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) 110px, 40vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1024\"/><noscript><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"646\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) 110px, 40vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/2804c002-Frame-150-2-1024x646-be56617c6643-1024.webp 1024w\" width=\"1024\"/></noscript></span><span class=\"hub-path-content\"><span class=\"hub-path-label\">Videos<span class=\"hub-count\">59 videos</span></span><strong>Find a new perspective.</strong><span class=\"hub-path-text\">Talks, podcasts and field videos.</span><span class=\"hub-path-go\">Watch videos<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></span></a><a class=\"hub-path\" href=\"/courses/\"><span class=\"hub-path-image\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-1400.webp 1400w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) 110px, 40vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1400\"/><noscript><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) 110px, 40vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae7acf20-a13-swale-4617512ddac0-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/></noscript></span><span class=\"hub-path-content\"><span class=\"hub-path-label\">Courses<span class=\"hub-count\">9 courses</span></span><strong>Make room to grow.</strong><span class=\"hub-path-text\">From independent providers. Fees and formats vary.</span><span class=\"hub-path-go\">Find a course<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></span></a><a class=\"hub-path is-local\" href=\"#reading\"><span class=\"hub-path-image\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-1400.webp 1400w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) 110px, 40vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1400\"/><noscript><img alt=\"\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:600px) 110px, 40vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/0102a741-a14-seeds-858c5f6cbf2d-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/></noscript></span><span class=\"hub-path-content\"><span class=\"hub-path-label\">Reading<span class=\"hub-count\">11 pieces</span></span><strong>Read beyond the surface.</strong><span class=\"hub-path-text\">Research, field reports, essays and guides.</span><span class=\"hub-path-go\">Explore the reading library<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></span></a></nav></section><section class=\"library-section reading-library\" data-reading-library=\"\" id=\"reading\"><header class=\"library-heading\"><h2>Reading.</h2><p>Research, field reports, essays and guides. Each piece is labelled, so you know what kind of source you are reading.</p></header><div class=\"library-tools\"><form class=\"library-search\" data-reading-search=\"\" role=\"search\"><label class=\"visually-hidden\" for=\"reading-query\">Search the reading library</label><input autocomplete=\"off\" data-reading-input=\"\" id=\"reading-query\" placeholder=\"Search titles, authors or topics\" type=\"search\"/><button aria-label=\"Search the reading library\" type=\"submit\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></button></form><div aria-label=\"Filter by source type\" class=\"library-filters\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-reading-filter=\"all\" type=\"button\">All</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-reading-filter=\"research\" type=\"button\">Research</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-reading-filter=\"field-report\" type=\"button\">Field reports</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data-reading-filter=\"essay-guide\" type=\"button\">Essays &amp; guides</button></div></div><div class=\"library-result-line\"><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"results-count\" data-reading-count=\"\" role=\"status\">11 pieces</span><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/about/#criteria\"><span>How resources are chosen</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"reading-list\"><article class=\"reading-item\" data-folio=\"01\" data-group=\"field-report\" data-reading-item=\"\" data-search=\"Issue No. 001 · Building Community Resilience Field report Baganihan Collective · Community situation report, July 2026 Communities face rising uncertainty from climate, the economy, and global instability, yet the effects land locally. This first report is a guide to seeing change early, strengthening what a community already has, and deciding together through systems thinking and Community Continuity Management.\"><div class=\"reading-visual\"><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of resilience\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2528\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of resilience\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-resilience-2bd84e25a19a-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2528\"/></noscript></div><div class=\"reading-main\"><div class=\"reading-eyebrow\"><span class=\"reading-type\">Field report</span><span class=\"reading-number\">01 / 11</span></div><h3><a href=\"/resources/baganihan/issue-001-community-resilience/\">Issue No. 001 · Building Community Resilience</a></h3><p class=\"reading-source\">Baganihan Collective · Community situation report, July 2026</p><p class=\"reading-summary\">Communities face rising uncertainty from climate, the economy, and global instability, yet the effects land locally. This first report is a guide to seeing change early, strengthening what a community already has, and deciding together through systems thinking and Community Continuity Management.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-go\">Read the report<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></div></article><article class=\"reading-item\" data-folio=\"02\" data-group=\"essay-guide\" data-reading-item=\"\" data-search=\"Why Master Planning Will Fail Without Resiliency Security Essay Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas · Baganihan Collective, October 2026 Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas argues that Philippine land and infrastructure planning still assumes a stable climate and a predictable global economy, and that the answer is ecological design joined to organised community capacity. Part one of a series from the Baganihan Collective.\"><div class=\"reading-visual\"><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of waterways\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2528\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of waterways\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-waterways-b99875b291da-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2528\"/></noscript></div><div class=\"reading-main\"><div class=\"reading-eyebrow\"><span class=\"reading-type\">Essay</span><span class=\"reading-number\">02 / 11</span></div><h3><a href=\"/resources/baganihan-reports/mit-horizon-resiliency-security/\">Why Master Planning Will Fail Without Resiliency Security</a></h3><p class=\"reading-source\">Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas · Baganihan Collective, October 2026</p><p class=\"reading-summary\">Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas argues that Philippine land and infrastructure planning still assumes a stable climate and a predictable global economy, and that the answer is ecological design joined to organised community capacity. Part one of a series from the Baganihan Collective.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-go\">Read the essay<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></div></article><article class=\"reading-item\" data-folio=\"03\" data-group=\"essay-guide\" data-reading-item=\"\" data-search=\"Permaculture Beyond the Farm: Permanent Culture, Resilience and Security Essay Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas · Baganihan Collective, October 2026 Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas asks what permanent culture has to include if communities are to stay functional under stress. Drawing on risk management and community security work in the Philippines, he reads bayanihan as distributed capacity and argues that security may already be part of the culture permaculture is trying to design.\"><div class=\"reading-visual\"><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of food forest\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2528\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of food forest\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-food-forest-028d07305b09-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2528\"/></noscript></div><div class=\"reading-main\"><div class=\"reading-eyebrow\"><span class=\"reading-type\">Essay</span><span class=\"reading-number\">03 / 11</span></div><h3><a href=\"/resources/baganihan-reports/permaculture-beyond-the-farm/\">Permaculture Beyond the Farm: Permanent Culture, Resilience and Security</a></h3><p class=\"reading-source\">Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas · Baganihan Collective, October 2026</p><p class=\"reading-summary\">Hubert Joseph Balana Posadas asks what permanent culture has to include if communities are to stay functional under stress. Drawing on risk management and community security work in the Philippines, he reads bayanihan as distributed capacity and argues that security may already be part of the culture permaculture is trying to design.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-go\">Read the essay<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></div></article><article class=\"reading-item\" data-folio=\"04\" data-group=\"research\" data-reading-item=\"\" data-search=\"Working with Nature: How Filipino Practitioners See Permaculture Research Flores and Buot · UP Los Baños · Journal of Nature Studies, 2023 Two UP researchers spent three months on twelve Filipino farms asking seventeen practitioners what permaculture means to them. Three different answers came back, and each one showed up in the shape of the land.\"><div class=\"reading-visual\"><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of living soil\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2528\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of living soil\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-living-soil-b91b84e867e1-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2528\"/></noscript></div><div class=\"reading-main\"><div class=\"reading-eyebrow\"><span class=\"reading-type\">Research</span><span class=\"reading-number\">04 / 11</span></div><h3><a href=\"/resources/research/working-with-nature/\">Working with Nature: How Filipino Practitioners See Permaculture</a></h3><p class=\"reading-source\">Flores and Buot · UP Los Baños · Journal of Nature Studies, 2023</p><p class=\"reading-summary\">Two UP researchers spent three months on twelve Filipino farms asking seventeen practitioners what permaculture means to them. Three different answers came back, and each one showed up in the shape of the land.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-go\">Read the study<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></div></article><article class=\"reading-item\" data-folio=\"05\" data-group=\"research\" data-reading-item=\"\" data-search=\"Creating Virtual Corridors: Permaculture Networks on Facebook Research Flores and colleagues · UP Open University · IJODeL, 2017 Can a Facebook friendship carry permaculture from one garden to another? A UP Open University team scored 286 connections and found fourteen strong enough to count as living corridors across Luzon.\"><div class=\"reading-visual\"><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of field notes\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2528\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Editorial illustration of field notes\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1696\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-field-notes-8a4a18333811-320.webp 320w, 